
Tal lær: ['plus:'] betyder: ['+'].
Tal ved: ['+'] gør: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x betegnelse.
	(currency = ['euros']) sand: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (selv plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars kvalificér: ['dollars'].
euros kvalificér: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Uddata skriv: money, stop.
